{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>It's very simple. All you have to do is choose a person.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose a person you'd be fine spending the rest of your life with.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And then press the button corresponding to that person!</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Feeling Death&quot; is a mystery adventure game where you find yourself trapped in a deadly matchmaking game - one where becoming a couple means instant death. Through interactions and investigations with other participants, you'll need to find a way to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What is this matchmaking game?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753180/extras/ac42943f15c096bb618523f4825db580.avif?t=1761185011\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Everyone chooses a person, and if two people choose each other, that's a couple made.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In &quot;Feeling Death&quot;, if a match is made, that couple dies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Game Features:</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753180/extras/4641b3baff96057a550c371550eb3b25.avif?t=1761185011\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>The matchmaking game takes place around a round table, and it's up to you to decide who to choose in order to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2753180/extras/bbd68d609228508c6c749cd4ace6c34c.avif?t=1761185011\" width=1280 height=720 /></span>Deaths occur not only f